# ============================================================================
# TC-WEB-001  Homepage smoke
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Objective : JustDial homepage loads and its primary entry points render.
# Platform  : web          Priority : P0 (gate for every other web case)
# Suite     : suites/web_regression_suite.json
# Params    : base_site, home_heading_text
#
# Note: the web runner has no `verify element exists` (Appium-only). On web the
# equivalent assertion is `store text of <el> as <var>` — it resolves the
# locator, reads it, and raises if the element is absent, while also exercising
# the self-healing path. Use that, not a bare existence check.
# ============================================================================

# ── Arrange ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
open ${base_site}
wait for result page load
take screenshot as tc001_home_loaded

# ── Assert: page identity ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
store page url as home_url
store page title as home_title
verify stored home_url contains "justdial"

# ── Assert: primary search affordance is present ────────────────────────────
store attribute placeholder of search_box as search_placeholder

# ── Assert: category entry points render ────────────────────────────────────
store count of restaurant_hotkey as restaurant_tiles
store count of b2b_hotkey as b2b_tiles

# ── Assert: homepage marketing copy anchors the page ────────────────────────
verify text "${home_heading_text}"

take screenshot as tc001_home_verified
